    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-4b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4B Application to Norfolk Island",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-4b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This Act does not extend to Norfolk Island.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) ceases to be in force when the Telecommunications\nAct 1992 (Norfolk Island) is repealed.\nNote:\nOnce subsection (1) ceases to be in force this Act will extend to\nNorfolk Island because of section 18 of the Norfolk Island Act 1979.\n\nIntroduction  Chapter 1\nInterpretation  Part 1-2\n\nSection 5\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This Act does not extend to Norfolk Island.\n\n(2) Subsection (1) ceases to be in force when the Telecommunications\nAct 1992 (Norfolk Island) is repealed.\nNote:\nOnce subsection (1) ceases to be in force this Act will extend to\nNorfolk Island because of section 18 of the Norfolk Island Act 1979.\n\nIntroduction  Chapter 1\nInterpretation  Part 1-2\n\nSection 5\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
