      "skos:note": "Ceases to be in force when the Telecommunications Act 1992 (Norfolk Island) is repealed."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-4b-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4B(2) Application to Norfolk Island",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subsection (1) ceases to be in force when the Telecommunications\nAct 1992 (Norfolk Island) is repealed.\nNote:\nOnce subsection (1) ceases to be in force this Act will extend to\nNorfolk Island because of section 18 of the Norfolk Island Act 1979.\n\nIntroduction  Chapter 1\nInterpretation  Part 1-2\n\nSection 5\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026"
    },
