      "values:originalText": "(1) The head (however described) of an enforcement agency may, by\nwriting, authorise a management office or management position in\nthe enforcement agency for the purposes of subparagraph (b)(iii) of\nthe definition of authorised officer in subsection 5(1).\n\nIntroduction  Chapter 1\nInterpretation  Part 1-2\n\nSection 5AC\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nAuthorised officers of the Australian Federal Police"
