      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 72,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A copy of an authorisation must be given to the Communications\nAccess Coordinator:\n\n(a) in the case of an authorisation made under subsection (1)—\nby the head of the enforcement agency; and\n\n(b) in the case of an authorisation made under subsection (1A)—\nby the Commissioner of Police.\nAuthorisations are not legislative instruments"
    },
