      "values:originalText": "(4) The Commissioner of a Police Force of a State may authorise, in\nwriting, an officer of the police force of the State whose rank is\nequivalent to that of a senior executive AFP employee who is a\nmember of the Australian Federal Police to be a certifying officer\nof the Police Force of the State.\n\nChapter 1  Introduction",
