      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, a communication is accessible to its\nintended recipient if it:\n\n(a) has been received by the telecommunications service\nprovided to the intended recipient; or\n\n(b) is under the control of the intended recipient; or\n\n(c) has been delivered to the telecommunications service\nprovided to the intended recipient.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Act, a communication is accessible to its\nintended recipient if it:\n\n(a) has been received by the telecommunications service\nprovided to the intended recipient; or\n\n(b) is under the control of the intended recipient; or\n\n(c) has been delivered to the telecommunications service\nprovided to the intended recipient.",
      "values:partOf": {
