      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.90",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Subsection (1) does not limit the circumstances in which a\ncommunication may be taken to be accessible to its intended\nrecipient for the purposes of this Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Subsection (1) does not limit the circumstances in which a\ncommunication may be taken to be accessible to its intended\nrecipient for the purposes of this Act.",
