      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.90",
      "values:originalText": "(2D) If the Minister makes a declaration under subsection (2B), the\nMinister must, by legislative instrument, specify:\n\n(a) the name of the force or service operating the premises to\nwhich the declaration relates; and\n\n(b) the geographical region in which those premises are located.",
      "skos:definition": "(2D) If the Minister makes a declaration under subsection (2B), the\nMinister must, by legislative instrument, specify:\n\n(a) the name of the force or service operating the premises to\nwhich the declaration relates; and\n\n(b) the geographical region in which those premises are located.",
