      "skos:note": "Protection and immunity for nominated ART members issuing warrants"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-6da-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6DA(4) Nominated ART members",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 96,
      "values:originalText": "(4) A nominated ART member has, in performing a function of or\nconnected with, issuing a warrant under Part 2-5, the same\nprotection and immunity as a Justice of the High Court has in\nrelation to proceedings in the High Court."
    },
