    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-6e-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6E(2) Lawfully intercepted information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-6e-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.99",
      "values:originalText": "(2) A reference in this Act to lawfully intercepted information that was\noriginally obtained by an agency, or by an eligible authority of a\nState, is a reference to:\n\n(a) information obtained, whether before or after the\ncommencement of this section, by intercepting a\ncommunication under a warrant issued to the agency or\nauthority; or\n\n(b) information communicated to the agency or authority in\naccordance with section 65A or 63E.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) A reference in this Act to lawfully intercepted information that was\noriginally obtained by an agency, or by an eligible authority of a\nState, is a reference to:\n\n(a) information obtained, whether before or after the\ncommencement of this section, by intercepting a\ncommunication under a warrant issued to the agency or\nauthority; or\n\n(b) information communicated to the agency or authority in\naccordance with section 65A or 63E.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-6e"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-6e-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-6e-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "db5d93eae44c433b4da5cc39c79d97c25ff68e2437343a97868712befb5a1549",
      "skos:note": "Lawfully intercepted information must be referred to as obtained through intercepting a communication under a warrant or in accordance with section 65A or 63E."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-6e-ss-2",
