    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-6k",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6K Proceeding for confiscation or forfeiture or for pecuniary",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-6k"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.103",
      "values:originalText": "penalty\n\nA reference in this Act to a proceeding, or to a proceeding under a\nlaw of the Commonwealth, for the confiscation or forfeiture of\nproperty, or for the imposition of a pecuniary penalty, in\nconnection with the commission of a prescribed offence includes a\nreference to:\n\n(a) a proceeding for the condemnation or recovery of a ship or\naircraft, or of goods, seized under section 203 of the Customs\n\nChapter 1  Introduction",
      "skos:definition": "penalty\n\nA reference in this Act to a proceeding, or to a proceeding under a\nlaw of the Commonwealth, for the confiscation or forfeiture of\nproperty, or for the imposition of a pecuniary penalty, in\nconnection with the commission of a prescribed offence includes a\nreference to:\n\n(a) a proceeding for the condemnation or recovery of a ship or\naircraft, or of goods, seized under section 203 of the Customs\n\nChapter 1  Introduction",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-6k-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-6k-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-6k-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "73ca1eeb08a1507960fbbd3a205618790f617427a137120a607c32694d6d39ee",
      "skos:note": "Reference to confiscation or forfeiture proceedings includes condemnation or recovery of seized goods."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-6k",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6K Proceeding for confiscation or forfeiture or for pecuniary",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 103,
      "values:originalText": "penalty\n\nA reference in this Act to a proceeding, or to a proceeding under a\nlaw of the Commonwealth, for the confiscation or forfeiture of\nproperty, or for the imposition of a pecuniary penalty, in\nconnection with the commission of a prescribed offence includes a\nreference to:\n\n(a) a proceeding for the condemnation or recovery of a ship or\naircraft, or of goods, seized under section 203 of the Customs\n\nChapter 1  Introduction"
    },
