      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.108",
      "values:originalText": "(2C) A person or body, or a class of persons or bodies, specified in an\ninstrument made under subsection (2) may only perform the\nfunctions or exercise the powers specified in that instrument in\nrelation to that person or body, or class of persons or bodies.",
      "skos:definition": "(2C) A person or body, or a class of persons or bodies, specified in an\ninstrument made under subsection (2) may only perform the\nfunctions or exercise the powers specified in that instrument in\nrelation to that person or body, or class of persons or bodies.",
