    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-6r-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6R(3) Communications Access Coordinator",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-6r-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.108",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Unless the context otherwise requires, an act done by or in relation\nto a Communications Access Coordinator is taken to be an act\ndone by or in relation to the Coordinator on behalf of all the\ninterception agencies and all the enforcement agencies.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Unless the context otherwise requires, an act done by or in relation\nto a Communications Access Coordinator is taken to be an act\ndone by or in relation to the Coordinator on behalf of all the\ninterception agencies and all the enforcement agencies.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-6r"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-6r-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-6r-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1e65b9be24562a28803aa566cc24258edb850b3ed91377acff652aa44daa6400",
      "skos:note": "Act done by or in relation to the Coordinator is taken to be an act done on behalf of all agencies."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-6r-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6R(3) Communications Access Coordinator",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 108,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Unless the context otherwise requires, an act done by or in relation\nto a Communications Access Coordinator is taken to be an act\ndone by or in relation to the Coordinator on behalf of all the\ninterception agencies and all the enforcement agencies."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-6r-ss-3-norm",
