      "cml:premiseText": "Act done by or in relation to the Coordinator is an act done on behalf of all agencies.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "All acts done by or in relation to the Coordinator are acts done on behalf of all agencies."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-6s",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6S Permitted purposes—integrity purposes",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-6s"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.109",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of paragraph (aaa) of the definition of permitted\npurpose in subsection 5(1), a purpose mentioned in column 2 of an\nitem in the following table is a permitted purpose in relation to a\nCommonwealth agency, or the Immigration and Border Protection\nDepartment, as mentioned in column 1 of that item.\n\n\nChapter 1  Introduction",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of paragraph (aaa) of the definition of permitted\npurpose in subsection 5(1), a purpose mentioned in column 2 of an\nitem in the following table is a permitted purpose in relation to a\nCommonwealth agency, or the Immigration and Border Protection\nDepartment, as mentioned in column 1 of that item.\n\n\nChapter 1  Introduction",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-6s-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "478c4c2f9d702e424842aa92dffa2ab14a102b20f89a75bd4f337feff06872a4",
      "skos:note": "Permitted purposes for integrity purposes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-6s",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6S Permitted purposes—integrity purposes",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 109,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of paragraph (aaa) of the definition of permitted\npurpose in subsection 5(1), a purpose mentioned in column 2 of an\nitem in the following table is a permitted purpose in relation to a\nCommonwealth agency, or the Immigration and Border Protection\nDepartment, as mentioned in column 1 of that item.\n\n\nChapter 1  Introduction"
    },
