      "skos:definition": "(1) Where the Director-General of Security makes a request, otherwise\nthan in writing, for the issue of a warrant under section 9 or 9A, he\nor she must forthwith forward to the Attorney-General a request in\nwriting for the warrant.\nWarrants authorising entry",
