      "cml:premiseText": "...as persons authorized to exercise...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...the authority conferred by Part 2-2 warrants."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-12-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "12(2) Persons authorised to intercept communications for Organisation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-12-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.135",
      "values:originalText": "(2) To avoid doubt, and without limiting subsection (1), if approval is\ngiven to a person or class of persons holding, occupying or\nperforming the duties of an office or position, then the approval\nextends to such an office or position that comes into existence after\nthe approval is given.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) To avoid doubt, and without limiting subsection (1), if approval is\ngiven to a person or class of persons holding, occupying or\nperforming the duties of an office or position, then the approval\nextends to such an office or position that comes into existence after\nthe approval is given.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-12"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-12-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "838f9160f422b250a533648d0c6b9d87b524ca20db6f282c7fd3e6a396f3d608",
      "skos:note": "Approval extends to new offices or positions"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-12-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "12(2) Persons authorised to intercept communications for Organisation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 135,
      "values:originalText": "(2) To avoid doubt, and without limiting subsection (1), if approval is\ngiven to a person or class of persons holding, occupying or\nperforming the duties of an office or position, then the approval\nextends to such an office or position that comes into existence after\nthe approval is given."
    },
