      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.135",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Subsection (2) does not, by implication, affect the interpretation of\nany other provision of this Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Subsection (2) does not, by implication, affect the interpretation of\nany other provision of this Act.",
      "values:partOf": {
