      "cml:integrityHash": "6ce0781ee9ab3562cc2b13a24fc2d514af4502a03ed10adc3149e23d40df4868",
      "skos:note": "Report on results of interception under Part 2-2 warrant"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-17-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "17(1) Reports to be made to Attorney-General on results of",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 140,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Director-General of Security shall furnish to the\nAttorney-General, in respect of each Part 2-2 warrant, within 3\nmonths after the expiration or revocation, whichever first occurs,\nof the warrant, a report in writing on the extent to which the\ninterception of communications under the warrant has assisted the\nOrganisation in carrying out its functions."
    },
    {
