      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.162",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The affidavit shall specify the period for which it is requested that\nthe warrant be in force and shall state why it is considered\nnecessary for the warrant to be in force for that period.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The affidavit shall specify the period for which it is requested that\nthe warrant be in force and shall state why it is considered\nnecessary for the warrant to be in force for that period.",
