    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-42-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "42(4) Affidavit to accompany written application",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-42-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.162",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the application is for a telecommunications service warrant, the\naffidavit shall set out, in relation to the service, and in relation to\neach person to whom the application relates, the following\ninformation, so far as it can be derived from the agency’s records:\n\n(a) the number of previous applications (if any) for warrants that\nthe agency has made and that related to the service or to that\nperson, as the case may be;\n\n(b) the number of warrants (if any) previously issued on such\napplications; and\n\n(c) particulars of the use made by the agency of information\nobtained by interceptions under such warrants.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If the application is for a telecommunications service warrant, the\naffidavit shall set out, in relation to the service, and in relation to\neach person to whom the application relates, the following\ninformation, so far as it can be derived from the agency’s records:\n\n(a) the number of previous applications (if any) for warrants that\nthe agency has made and that related to the service or to that\nperson, as the case may be;\n\n(b) the number of warrants (if any) previously issued on such\napplications; and\n\n(c) particulars of the use made by the agency of information\nobtained by interceptions under such warrants.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-42"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-42-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-42-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7db4e6d3450042fdd914f0e3d676c20dfe14028477c234a94d15668ce0bc6505",
      "skos:note": "Must provide information about previous applications and warrants.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-42-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "42(4) Affidavit to accompany written application",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 162,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the application is for a telecommunications service warrant, the\naffidavit shall set out, in relation to the service, and in relation to\neach person to whom the application relates, the following\ninformation, so far as it can be derived from the agency’s records:\n\n(a) the number of previous applications (if any) for warrants that\nthe agency has made and that related to the service or to that\nperson, as the case may be;\n\n(b) the number of warrants (if any) previously issued on such\napplications; and\n\n(c) particulars of the use made by the agency of information\nobtained by interceptions under such warrants."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-42-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
