      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.164",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A Judge or nominated ART member may require further\ninformation to be given in connection with an application to the\nJudge or nominated ART member for a warrant.\n\n(2) The further information:\n\n(a) shall be given on oath if the application was made in writing;\nand\n\n(b) shall be given orally or otherwise, as the Judge or nominated\nART member directs.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A Judge or nominated ART member may require further\ninformation to be given in connection with an application to the\nJudge or nominated ART member for a warrant.\n\n(2) The further information:\n\n(a) shall be given on oath if the application was made in writing;\nand\n\n(b) shall be given orally or otherwise, as the Judge or nominated\nART member directs.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
