    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-55-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "55(6) Exercise of authority conferred by warrant",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-55-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.199",
      "values:originalText": "(6) A reference in subsection (5) to the provision of technical\nassistance includes a reference to:\n\n(a) the doing of any act involved in the interception of a\ncommunication under a warrant, to the extent that the act is\nincidental to the doing of an act referred to in paragraph (b);\nand\n\nChapter 2  Interception of telecommunications",
      "skos:definition": "(6) A reference in subsection (5) to the provision of technical\nassistance includes a reference to:\n\n(a) the doing of any act involved in the interception of a\ncommunication under a warrant, to the extent that the act is\nincidental to the doing of an act referred to in paragraph (b);\nand\n\nChapter 2  Interception of telecommunications",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-55"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-55-ss-6-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ffd4c6a42ab64a5b465f6fb24cf533f92a408a945450dfdeacc20ab139571d78",
      "skos:note": "A reference to the doing of an act involved in the interception of a communication under a warrant."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-55-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "55(6) Exercise of authority conferred by warrant",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 199,
      "values:originalText": "(6) A reference in subsection (5) to the provision of technical\nassistance includes a reference to:\n\n(a) the doing of any act involved in the interception of a\ncommunication under a warrant, to the extent that the act is\nincidental to the doing of an act referred to in paragraph (b);\nand\n\nChapter 2  Interception of telecommunications"
    },
