      "cml:integrityHash": "3f7d7fb5dc2ae304d9372873f960014bc967a90944dffe9e2787be8c44c08604",
      "skos:note": "Notify authorised representative of carrier upon warrant revocation.",
      "dc:description": "Copy of instrument of revocation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-60-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "60(3) Notification to authorised representative of carrier of issue or",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 204,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Where:\n\n(a) an authorised representative of a carrier has been informed,\nunder subsection (1), of the issue of a warrant; and\n\nInterception of telecommunications  Chapter 2\nWarrants authorising agencies to intercept telecommunications  Part 2-5\nWarrants  Division 4\n\nSection 60\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\n(b) the warrant is revoked;\na certifying officer of the agency to which the warrant was issued\nshall cause:\n\n(c) that authorised representative to be informed immediately of\nthe revocation; and\n\n(d) a copy of the instrument of revocation, certified in writing by\na certifying officer of the agency to be a true copy of the\ninstrument, to be given as soon as practicable to that\nauthorised representative."
    },
