    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-71-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "71(3) Dealing with information where interception suspected to be",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-71-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.242",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A person to whom the relevant information is communicated in\naccordance with subsection (2) may, for a purpose connected with:\n\n(a) an investigation of a suspected offence;\n\n(b) the making by an authority, body or person of a decision\nwhether or not to begin a proceeding by way of a prosecution\nfor a suspected offence; or\n\n(c) a proceeding by way of a prosecution for a suspected\noffence;\nor for 2 or more such purposes, and for no other purpose,\ncommunicate to another person, make use of, or make a record of,\nsome or all of the relevant information.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A person to whom the relevant information is communicated in\naccordance with subsection (2) may, for a purpose connected with:\n\n(a) an investigation of a suspected offence;\n\n(b) the making by an authority, body or person of a decision\nwhether or not to begin a proceeding by way of a prosecution\nfor a suspected offence; or\n\n(c) a proceeding by way of a prosecution for a suspected\noffence;\nor for 2 or more such purposes, and for no other purpose,\ncommunicate to another person, make use of, or make a record of,\nsome or all of the relevant information.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-71"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-71-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-71-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "27df7e7877a4fed428cfcff2d8bad1d4e230efc3cbe669b4bd46d37efdfe0a85",
      "skos:note": "Communicating relevant information for specific purposes."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-71-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "71(3) Dealing with information where interception suspected to be",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 242,
      "values:originalText": "(3) A person to whom the relevant information is communicated in\naccordance with subsection (2) may, for a purpose connected with:\n\n(a) an investigation of a suspected offence;\n\n(b) the making by an authority, body or person of a decision\nwhether or not to begin a proceeding by way of a prosecution\nfor a suspected offence; or\n\n(c) a proceeding by way of a prosecution for a suspected\noffence;\nor for 2 or more such purposes, and for no other purpose,\ncommunicate to another person, make use of, or make a record of,\nsome or all of the relevant information."
    },
