    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-76a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "76A Giving information in evidence in civil proceedings for remedial",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-76a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.246",
      "values:originalText": "relief\n\n(1) A person may give information obtained by intercepting a\ncommunication in contravention of subsection 7(1) in evidence in a\nproceeding by way of an application under section 107A for\nremedial relief in respect of:\n\n(a) the interception; or\n\n(b) the communication (in contravention of section 63) of\ninformation obtained by the interception.\n\n(2) A person may give interception warrant information in evidence in\na proceeding by way of an application under section 107A.\n\nInterception of telecommunications  Chapter 2\nDealing with intercepted information etc.  Part 2-6\n\nSection 77\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "relief\n\n(1) A person may give information obtained by intercepting a\ncommunication in contravention of subsection 7(1) in evidence in a\nproceeding by way of an application under section 107A for\nremedial relief in respect of:\n\n(a) the interception; or\n\n(b) the communication (in contravention of section 63) of\ninformation obtained by the interception.\n\n(2) A person may give interception warrant information in evidence in\na proceeding by way of an application under section 107A.\n\nInterception of telecommunications  Chapter 2\nDealing with intercepted information etc.  Part 2-6\n\nSection 77\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "cml:hasPart": [
