      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.259",
      "values:originalText": "When section applies\n\n(1) This section applies to an eligible authority of a State if the eligible\nauthority is an agency.\n\nChapter 2  Interception of telecommunications",
      "skos:definition": "When section applies\n\n(1) This section applies to an eligible authority of a State if the eligible\nauthority is an agency.\n\nChapter 2  Interception of telecommunications",
