    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-83",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "83 Inspections",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-83"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.260",
      "values:originalText": "(1AA) This section applies to each Commonwealth agency, except the\nACC.\nNote:\nInspections of ACC, including inspections relating to ACC’s\ncompliance with sections 79, 79AA, 79AB, 80 and 81 of this Act, are\nundertaken by the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security\nunder the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security Act 1986.\n\n(1) The Ombudsman shall inspect the records of each Commonwealth\nagency:\n\n(a) at least twice during the period beginning at the\ncommencement of this Part and ending on 30 June 1988; and\n\n(b) at least twice during each financial year beginning on or after",
      "skos:definition": "(1AA) This section applies to each Commonwealth agency, except the\nACC.\nNote:\nInspections of ACC, including inspections relating to ACC’s\ncompliance with sections 79, 79AA, 79AB, 80 and 81 of this Act, are\nundertaken by the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security\nunder the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security Act 1986.\n\n(1) The Ombudsman shall inspect the records of each Commonwealth\nagency:\n\n(a) at least twice during the period beginning at the\ncommencement of this Part and ending on 30 June 1988; and\n\n(b) at least twice during each financial year beginning on or after",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-83-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-83-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "39e6c2d2f1a615725d873a44f6905c96731e8d3a2efce2cc9aadfeb2272153cb",
      "skos:note": "Inspections of Commonwealth agencies, except ACC, are undertaken by the Ombudsman."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-83",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "83 Inspections",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 260,
      "values:originalText": "(1AA) This section applies to each Commonwealth agency, except the\nACC.\nNote:\nInspections of ACC, including inspections relating to ACC’s\ncompliance with sections 79, 79AA, 79AB, 80 and 81 of this Act, are\nundertaken by the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security\nunder the Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security Act 1986.\n\n(1) The Ombudsman shall inspect the records of each Commonwealth\nagency:\n\n(a) at least twice during the period beginning at the\ncommencement of this Part and ending on 30 June 1988; and\n\n(b) at least twice during each financial year beginning on or after"
    },
