    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-85",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "85 Ombudsman may report on other breaches of this Act",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-85"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.262",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If, as a result of an inspection under this Part of the records of an\nagency, the Ombudsman is of the opinion that an officer of the\nagency has contravened a provision of this Act, the Ombudsman\nmay include in his or her report on the inspection a report on the\ncontravention.\n\n(2) To avoid doubt, for the purposes of subsection (1), a contravention\nof a condition or restriction specified in a warrant issued under this\nAct is a contravention of a provision of this Act.\n\n(3) Subsection (1) does not apply to a contravention of section 79,\n79AA, 79AB, 80 or 81.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If, as a result of an inspection under this Part of the records of an\nagency, the Ombudsman is of the opinion that an officer of the\nagency has contravened a provision of this Act, the Ombudsman\nmay include in his or her report on the inspection a report on the\ncontravention.\n\n(2) To avoid doubt, for the purposes of subsection (1), a contravention\nof a condition or restriction specified in a warrant issued under this\nAct is a contravention of a provision of this Act.\n\n(3) Subsection (1) does not apply to a contravention of section 79,\n79AA, 79AB, 80 or 81.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-85-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-85-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-85-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e0fabbf549ecf091a17c43567554a2d30e80c423612ca7002cdf17cef2c9ff40"
    },
