      "values:originalText": "(2) The Ombudsman may, by writing given to the officer, require the\nofficer to give the information to the Ombudsman:\n\n(a) by writing signed by the officer; and\n\n(b) at a specified place and within a specified period.\n\nInterception of telecommunications  Chapter 2\nKeeping and inspection of interception records  Part 2-7\n\nSection 87\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The Ombudsman may, by writing given to the officer, require the\nofficer to give the information to the Ombudsman:\n\n(a) by writing signed by the officer; and\n\n(b) at a specified place and within a specified period.\n\nInterception of telecommunications  Chapter 2\nKeeping and inspection of interception records  Part 2-7\n\nSection 87\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
