      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.264",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The Ombudsman may, by writing given to the officer, require the\nofficer to attend:\n\n(a) before a specified inspecting officer;\n\n(b) at a specified place; and\n\n(c) within a specified period or at a specified time on a specified\nday;\nin order to answer questions relevant to the inspection.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Ombudsman may, by writing given to the officer, require the\nofficer to attend:\n\n(a) before a specified inspecting officer;\n\n(b) at a specified place; and\n\n(c) within a specified period or at a specified time on a specified\nday;\nin order to answer questions relevant to the inspection.",
