      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.272",
      "values:originalText": "(4) In this section:\nemergency interception action means an interception done under\nsubsection 7(4) or (5) or action taken under one of those\nsubsections to cause an interception to occur.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) In this section:\nemergency interception action means an interception done under\nsubsection 7(4) or (5) or action taken under one of those\nsubsections to cause an interception to occur.",
      "values:partOf": {
