    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-101",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "101 Report to contain particulars about duration of warrants",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-101"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.279",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The report shall set out, for each Commonwealth agency, and for\neach eligible authority of a State that was an agency at any time\nduring that year:\n\n(a) the average of the respective periods specified, in the Part 2-5\nwarrants that are original warrants and were issued on\napplications made by the agency or authority during that\nyear, as the periods for which the warrants were to be in\nforce; and\n\n(b) the average of the respective periods during which the\nwarrants referred to in paragraph (a) were in force; and\n\nChapter 2  Interception of telecommunications",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The report shall set out, for each Commonwealth agency, and for\neach eligible authority of a State that was an agency at any time\nduring that year:\n\n(a) the average of the respective periods specified, in the Part 2-5\nwarrants that are original warrants and were issued on\napplications made by the agency or authority during that\nyear, as the periods for which the warrants were to be in\nforce; and\n\n(b) the average of the respective periods during which the\nwarrants referred to in paragraph (a) were in force; and\n\nChapter 2  Interception of telecommunications",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-101-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-101-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "da80dd3fd6499c382d17cee06fa8d8bf82d99b80979b2389334805da9d02489a",
      "skos:note": "Report must contain particulars about duration of warrants",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-101",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "101 Report to contain particulars about duration of warrants",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 279,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The report shall set out, for each Commonwealth agency, and for\neach eligible authority of a State that was an agency at any time\nduring that year:\n\n(a) the average of the respective periods specified, in the Part 2-5\nwarrants that are original warrants and were issued on\napplications made by the agency or authority during that\nyear, as the periods for which the warrants were to be in\nforce; and\n\n(b) the average of the respective periods during which the\nwarrants referred to in paragraph (a) were in force; and\n\nChapter 2  Interception of telecommunications"
    },
