    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-102",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "102 Report to contain information about effectiveness of warrants",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-102"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.281",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The report shall set out, for each Commonwealth agency, for each\neligible Commonwealth authority, and for each eligible authority\nof a State:\n\n(a) how many arrests were made during that year:\n\n(i) in connection with the performance by the agency or\nauthority of its functions; and\n\n(ii) on the basis of information that was or included\nlawfully intercepted information;\n\n(b) the categories of the prescribed offences proceedings by way\nof prosecutions for which ended during that year, being\nproceedings in which, according to the records of the agency\nor authority, lawfully intercepted information was given in\nevidence; and\n\n(c) in relation to each of those categories:\n\n(i) the number of such offences in that category; and\n\n(ii) the number of such offences in that category in respect\nof which convictions were recorded.\n\n(2) The report shall set out:\n\n(a) how many arrests were made during that year:\n\n(i) in connection with the performance by Commonwealth\nagencies, by eligible Commonwealth authorities, and by\n\nChapter 2  Interception of telecommunications",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The report shall set out, for each Commonwealth agency, for each\neligible Commonwealth authority, and for each eligible authority\nof a State:\n\n(a) how many arrests were made during that year:\n\n(i) in connection with the performance by the agency or\nauthority of its functions; and\n\n(ii) on the basis of information that was or included\nlawfully intercepted information;\n\n(b) the categories of the prescribed offences proceedings by way\nof prosecutions for which ended during that year, being\nproceedings in which, according to the records of the agency\nor authority, lawfully intercepted information was given in\nevidence; and\n\n(c) in relation to each of those categories:\n\n(i) the number of such offences in that category; and\n\n(ii) the number of such offences in that category in respect\nof which convictions were recorded.\n\n(2) The report shall set out:\n\n(a) how many arrests were made during that year:\n\n(i) in connection with the performance by Commonwealth\nagencies, by eligible Commonwealth authorities, and by\n\nChapter 2  Interception of telecommunications",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-102-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-102-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "85157a64f11feb9e3fb61181bc666e0d9ec44a30cf172e18a0525910d80e5d1b"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-102",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "102 Report to contain information about effectiveness of warrants",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 281,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The report shall set out, for each Commonwealth agency, for each\neligible Commonwealth authority, and for each eligible authority\nof a State:\n\n(a) how many arrests were made during that year:\n\n(i) in connection with the performance by the agency or\nauthority of its functions; and\n\n(ii) on the basis of information that was or included\nlawfully intercepted information;\n\n(b) the categories of the prescribed offences proceedings by way\nof prosecutions for which ended during that year, being\nproceedings in which, according to the records of the agency\nor authority, lawfully intercepted information was given in\nevidence; and\n\n(c) in relation to each of those categories:\n\n(i) the number of such offences in that category; and\n\n(ii) the number of such offences in that category in respect\nof which convictions were recorded.\n\n(2) The report shall set out:\n\n(a) how many arrests were made during that year:\n\n(i) in connection with the performance by Commonwealth\nagencies, by eligible Commonwealth authorities, and by\n\nChapter 2  Interception of telecommunications"
    },
