      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "102(2) Report to contain information about effectiveness of warrants",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 281,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The report shall set out:\n\n(a) how many arrests were made during that year:\n\n(i) in connection with the performance by Commonwealth\nagencies, by eligible Commonwealth authorities, and by\n\nChapter 2  Interception of telecommunications"
    },
