    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-103b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "103B Deferral of inclusion of information in report",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-103b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.286",
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies to information:\n\n(a) included in a report submitted to the Minister:\n\n(i) under section 84 by the Ombudsman in relation to a\nCommonwealth agency; or\n\n(ii) under section 94 by the chief officer of a\nCommonwealth agency; or\n\n(iii) under section 96 by the chief officer of an eligible\nauthority of a State; and\n\n(b) that the Minister would, apart from this section, be required\nto include in the next Ministerial report.\nExclusion of information\n\n(2) If the chief officer of the Commonwealth agency or eligible\nauthority is satisfied that the information is Part 5.3 information or",
      "skos:definition": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies to information:\n\n(a) included in a report submitted to the Minister:\n\n(i) under section 84 by the Ombudsman in relation to a\nCommonwealth agency; or\n\n(ii) under section 94 by the chief officer of a\nCommonwealth agency; or\n\n(iii) under section 96 by the chief officer of an eligible\nauthority of a State; and\n\n(b) that the Minister would, apart from this section, be required\nto include in the next Ministerial report.\nExclusion of information\n\n(2) If the chief officer of the Commonwealth agency or eligible\nauthority is satisfied that the information is Part 5.3 information or",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-103b-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-103b-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b073f6c68ef8721107fd9815b19b2c35ec111d526b75c2123d1111ba64424000"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-103b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "103B Deferral of inclusion of information in report",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 286,
      "values:originalText": "Scope\n\n(1) This section applies to information:\n\n(a) included in a report submitted to the Minister:\n\n(i) under section 84 by the Ombudsman in relation to a\nCommonwealth agency; or\n\n(ii) under section 94 by the chief officer of a\nCommonwealth agency; or\n\n(iii) under section 96 by the chief officer of an eligible\nauthority of a State; and\n\n(b) that the Minister would, apart from this section, be required\nto include in the next Ministerial report.\nExclusion of information\n\n(2) If the chief officer of the Commonwealth agency or eligible\nauthority is satisfied that the information is Part 5.3 information or"
    },
