      "values:originalText": "Interception—civil court remedy\n\n(1) An application under subsection 107A(3) for the grant of remedial\nrelief in respect of an interception is to be made within 6 years\nafter the end of the interception.\nCommunication—civil court remedy\n\n(2) An application under subsection 107A(4) for the grant of remedial\nrelief in respect of a communication of information is to be made\nwithin 6 years after the communication.\nCriminal court remedies\n\n(3) An application under subsection 107A(5) or (6) for the grant of\nremedial relief is not subject to any limitation period, but must be\nmade as soon as practicable after the conviction concerned."
