      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.299",
      "values:originalText": "(2) However, the agency can only give the notice if the conditions in\nsubsection 107J(1) or (2) are satisfied.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) However, the agency can only give the notice if the conditions in\nsubsection 107J(1) or (2) are satisfied.",
