      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.299",
      "values:originalText": "Notices given by criminal law-enforcement agencies\n\n(1) A domestic preservation notice may be given under\nsubsection 107H(1) if:\n\n(a) the issuing agency is:\n\n(i) for an historic domestic preservation notice—a criminal\nlaw-enforcement agency; and\n\nChapter 3  Preserving and accessing stored communications",
      "skos:definition": "Notices given by criminal law-enforcement agencies\n\n(1) A domestic preservation notice may be given under\nsubsection 107H(1) if:\n\n(a) the issuing agency is:\n\n(i) for an historic domestic preservation notice—a criminal\nlaw-enforcement agency; and\n\nChapter 3  Preserving and accessing stored communications",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-107j-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "006ad4aa5c73b6f6b85beba11be4bdaba634ed5b0cca6de64e3fde541b25630c",
      "skos:note": "Conditions for giving domestic preservation notices"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-107j",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "107J Conditions for giving domestic preservation notices",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 299,
      "values:originalText": "Notices given by criminal law-enforcement agencies\n\n(1) A domestic preservation notice may be given under\nsubsection 107H(1) if:\n\n(a) the issuing agency is:\n\n(i) for an historic domestic preservation notice—a criminal\nlaw-enforcement agency; and\n\nChapter 3  Preserving and accessing stored communications"
    },
    {
