      "cof:pageNumber": 315,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The application must be made on the agency’s behalf by:\n\n(a) if the agency is referred to in subsection 39(2)—a person\nreferred to in that subsection in relation to that agency; or\n\n(b) otherwise:\n\n(i) the chief officer of the agency; or\n\n(ii) an officer of the agency (by whatever name called) who\nholds, or is acting in, an office or position in the agency\nnominated under subsection (3)."
    },
