      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.356",
      "values:originalText": "warrants\n\nThe Minister must, as soon as practicable after each 30 June, cause\nto be prepared a written report that relates to the year ending on\nthat 30 June and complies with this Division.",
      "skos:definition": "warrants\n\nThe Minister must, as soon as practicable after each 30 June, cause\nto be prepared a written report that relates to the year ending on\nthat 30 June and complies with this Division.",
