      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.363",
      "values:originalText": "No limitation\n\n(1) This Part does not limit any liability (whether criminal or civil) that\na person has under any other provision of this Act or under any\nother law.\n\nChapter 3  Preserving and accessing stored communications",
      "skos:definition": "No limitation\n\n(1) This Part does not limit any liability (whether criminal or civil) that\na person has under any other provision of this Act or under any\nother law.\n\nChapter 3  Preserving and accessing stored communications",
      "cml:asserts": [
