      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.364",
      "values:originalText": "This Part does not enable an inferior court of a State or Territory to\ngrant remedial relief of a kind that the court is unable to grant\nunder the law of that State or Territory.",
      "skos:definition": "This Part does not enable an inferior court of a State or Territory to\ngrant remedial relief of a kind that the court is unable to grant\nunder the law of that State or Territory.",
