    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-176-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "176(2) Authorisations for access to prospective information or",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-176-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.368",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The following persons (each of whom is an eligible person):\n\n(a) the Director-General of Security;\n\n(b) the Deputy Director-General of Security;\n\n(c) an ASIO employee or ASIO affiliate who holds, or is acting\nin, a position that is equivalent to, or that is higher than, an\nSES Band 2 position in the Department;\nmay authorise the disclosure of specified information or specified\ndocuments that come into existence during the period for which the\nauthorisation is in force.\nAuthorisation for access to existing information or documents may\nalso be sought",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The following persons (each of whom is an eligible person):\n\n(a) the Director-General of Security;\n\n(b) the Deputy Director-General of Security;\n\n(c) an ASIO employee or ASIO affiliate who holds, or is acting\nin, a position that is equivalent to, or that is higher than, an\nSES Band 2 position in the Department;\nmay authorise the disclosure of specified information or specified\ndocuments that come into existence during the period for which the\nauthorisation is in force.\nAuthorisation for access to existing information or documents may\nalso be sought",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-176"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-176-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-176-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7dace1635ff7f6ad2b93be6c187c0e6546783b5574e81665c13c538fa95a08d3",
      "skos:note": "Authorized persons may disclose specified information or documents"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-176-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "176(2) Authorisations for access to prospective information or",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 368,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The following persons (each of whom is an eligible person):\n\n(a) the Director-General of Security;\n\n(b) the Deputy Director-General of Security;\n\n(c) an ASIO employee or ASIO affiliate who holds, or is acting\nin, a position that is equivalent to, or that is higher than, an\nSES Band 2 position in the Department;\nmay authorise the disclosure of specified information or specified\ndocuments that come into existence during the period for which the\nauthorisation is in force.\nAuthorisation for access to existing information or documents may\nalso be sought"
    },
