          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-176-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-176-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e46c6b3f741f34b44b46152262c1e0137d0dc80f9b704f43fe20aa1bb32b3fdc",
      "skos:note": "Authorisation for disclosure of specified information or documents that came into existence before the authorisation comes into force."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-176-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "176(3) Authorisations for access to prospective information or",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 368,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The eligible person may, in that authorisation, also authorise the\ndisclosure of specified information or specified documents that\ncame into existence before the time the authorisation comes into\nforce.\n\nAccess to telecommunications data  Chapter 4\nPermitted access to telecommunications data  Part 4-1\nThe Organisation  Division 3\n\nSection 176\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nLimits on making the authorisation"
    },
