      "values:originalText": "(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare:\n\n(a) an authority or body to be an enforcement agency; and\n\n(b) persons specified, or of a kind specified, in the declaration to\nbe officers of the enforcement agency for the purposes of this\nAct.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare:\n\n(a) an authority or body to be an enforcement agency; and\n\n(b) persons specified, or of a kind specified, in the declaration to\nbe officers of the enforcement agency for the purposes of this\nAct.",
