    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-177-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "177(3) Voluntary disclosure",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-177-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.372",
      "values:originalText": "(3) This section does not apply if a relevant staff member of an\nenforcement agency requests the holder to disclose the information\nor document.\nNote:\nSections 178 to 180 deal with the disclosure of information or a\ndocument in response to authorisations by an authorised officer of an\nenforcement agency.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) This section does not apply if a relevant staff member of an\nenforcement agency requests the holder to disclose the information\nor document.\nNote:\nSections 178 to 180 deal with the disclosure of information or a\ndocument in response to authorisations by an authorised officer of an\nenforcement agency.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-177"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-177-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "02d99fe69d5c21d2ddacebedea2d03e4b7abd98621a21ece228f874d2e599086",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure not required if requested by enforcement agency staff"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-177-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "177(3) Voluntary disclosure",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 372,
      "values:originalText": "(3) This section does not apply if a relevant staff member of an\nenforcement agency requests the holder to disclose the information\nor document.\nNote:\nSections 178 to 180 deal with the disclosure of information or a\ndocument in response to authorisations by an authorised officer of an\nenforcement agency."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-177-ss-3-norm",
