    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-180d-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "180D(1) Authorisations to disclose information or documents—",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 381,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If specified information or specified documents are disclosed\nbecause of an authorisation given under this Division, an\nauthorised officer of the Australian Federal Police may authorise\nthe following:\n\n(a) the disclosure of the information or documents to the\nOrganisation or an enforcement agency;\n\n(b) the use of the information or documents by the Australian\nFederal Police."
    },
