      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.382",
      "values:originalText": "(2) A determination made under paragraph (1)(c) is not a legislative\ninstrument.\n\nAccess to telecommunications data  Chapter 4\nPermitted access to telecommunications data  Part 4-1\nPrivacy to be considered when making authorisations  Division 4B\n\nSection 180F\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "skos:definition": "(2) A determination made under paragraph (1)(c) is not a legislative\ninstrument.\n\nAccess to telecommunications data  Chapter 4\nPermitted access to telecommunications data  Part 4-1\nPrivacy to be considered when making authorisations  Division 4B\n\nSection 180F\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-180e"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-180e-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c6cba737741e0869a463b15df8dc18c9654cbcedf6129018ea01a5ace472db68",
      "skos:note": "Legislative instrument is not a determination made under paragraph (1)(c)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-180e-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "180E(2) Disclosing information etc. to foreign countries or foreign law",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 382,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A determination made under paragraph (1)(c) is not a legislative\ninstrument.\n\nAccess to telecommunications data  Chapter 4\nPermitted access to telecommunications data  Part 4-1\nPrivacy to be considered when making authorisations  Division 4B\n\nSection 180F\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-180e-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-180e-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
