    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-180k",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "180K Further information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-180k"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.386",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Attorney-General may require the Director-General of\nSecurity to give to the Attorney-General, within the period\nspecified in the requirement, further information in connection\nwith a request under this Subdivision.\n\n(2) If the Director-General breaches the requirement, the\nAttorney-General may:\n\n(a) refuse to consider the request; or\n\n(b) refuse to take any action, or any further action, in relation to\nthe request.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Attorney-General may require the Director-General of\nSecurity to give to the Attorney-General, within the period\nspecified in the requirement, further information in connection\nwith a request under this Subdivision.\n\n(2) If the Director-General breaches the requirement, the\nAttorney-General may:\n\n(a) refuse to consider the request; or\n\n(b) refuse to take any action, or any further action, in relation to\nthe request.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-180k-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-180k-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5d648ca7cd8f02c4f41c4fba333382c1ea2c48480284bbc7f734a84e8b07b22d"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-180k",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "180K Further information",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 386,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Attorney-General may require the Director-General of\nSecurity to give to the Attorney-General, within the period\nspecified in the requirement, further information in connection\nwith a request under this Subdivision.\n\n(2) If the Director-General breaches the requirement, the\nAttorney-General may:\n\n(a) refuse to consider the request; or\n\n(b) refuse to take any action, or any further action, in relation to\nthe request."
    },
