        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "be14d078cc91baeb5d169f366d00c6ae1ee58deb03c07b9a1bcbf23e510ec825",
      "skos:note": "Application for journalist information may be made in writing or any other form."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-180q-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "180Q(5) Enforcement agency may apply for a journalist information",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 390,
      "values:originalText": "(5) The application may be made in writing or in any other form.\n\nAccess to telecommunications data  Chapter 4\nPermitted access to telecommunications data  Part 4-1\nJournalist information warrants  Division 4C\n\nSection 180R\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nNote:\nThe Electronic Transactions Act 1999 deals with giving information\nin writing by means of an electronic communication."
    },
