      "values:originalText": "(5) Neither of subsections (3) and (4) prevents the issue of a further\nwarrant under this Act in relation to a person, in relation to which a\nwarrant under this Act has, or warrants under this Act have,\npreviously been issued.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Neither of subsections (3) and (4) prevents the issue of a further\nwarrant under this Act in relation to a person, in relation to which a\nwarrant under this Act has, or warrants under this Act have,\npreviously been issued.",
