    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-181a-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "181A(5) Disclosure/use offences: authorisations under Division 3",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 396,
      "values:originalText": "(5) A person commits an offence if:\n\n(a) the person uses a document; and\n\n(b) the document consists (wholly or partly) of any of the\nfollowing:\n\n(i) an authorisation under Division 3;\n\n(ii) the revocation of such an authorisation;\n\nChapter 4  Access to telecommunications data"
    },
