      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "185 Retention of authorisations",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 407,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The head (however described) of an enforcement agency must\nretain an authorisation made under Division 4 of Part 4-1 by an\nauthorised officer of the enforcement agency for the period of 3\nyears beginning on the day the authorisation is made.\n\n(2) The Commissioner of Police must retain an authorisation made\nunder Division 4A of Part 4-1 by an authorised officer of the\n\nChapter 4  Access to telecommunications data"
    },
    {
