      "cml:premiseText": "(b) an enforcement agency, except the ACC or any agency, or part of an agency performing any functions, prescribed by regulations made under the Ombudsman Act 1976 for the purposes of subsection (1B) of this section, has records that relate to the performance of that function or the exercise of that power;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The records are related to the performance of a function or exercise of power within a certain time frame."
    },
