      "values:originalText": "(1B) Regulations made under the Ombudsman Act 1976 may prescribe\ncertain agencies, or functions of certain agencies, for the purposes\nof this subsection."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186b-ss-1b-norm",
