      "cml:integrityHash": "492c86a8bd95d171fdd94e1daa9a0dbd181dfad6ebc21a36b0c802edad374875",
      "skos:note": "No requirement to inspect all records"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-186b-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "186B(5) Inspection of records",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 421,
      "values:originalText": "(5) To avoid doubt, subsection (1) does not require the Ombudsman to\ninspect all of the records of an enforcement agency that are\nrelevant to the matters referred to in paragraphs (1)(a) and (b)."
    },
