    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186b-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "186B(6) Inspection of records",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-186b-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.421",
      "values:originalText": "(6) While an operation is being conducted under:\n\n(a) a stored communications warrant; or\n\n(b) an authorisation under Division 3, 4 or 4A of Part 4-1;\n\nOversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman  Chapter 4A\n\nSection 186C\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nthe Ombudsman may refrain from inspecting any records of the\nagency concerned that are relevant to the obtaining or execution of\nthe warrant or authorisation.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) While an operation is being conducted under:\n\n(a) a stored communications warrant; or\n\n(b) an authorisation under Division 3, 4 or 4A of Part 4-1;\n\nOversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman  Chapter 4A\n\nSection 186C\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nthe Ombudsman may refrain from inspecting any records of the\nagency concerned that are relevant to the obtaining or execution of\nthe warrant or authorisation.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186b"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186b-ss-6-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7859b4b0aaf53d8e77c47051fe728abf580fee6d86b38c609a5585a95ad6b85d",
      "skos:note": "The Ombudsman may refrain from inspecting records relevant to the obtaining or execution of a warrant or authorisation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-186b-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "186B(6) Inspection of records",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 421,
      "values:originalText": "(6) While an operation is being conducted under:\n\n(a) a stored communications warrant; or\n\n(b) an authorisation under Division 3, 4 or 4A of Part 4-1;\n\nOversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman  Chapter 4A\n\nSection 186C\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nthe Ombudsman may refrain from inspecting any records of the\nagency concerned that are relevant to the obtaining or execution of\nthe warrant or authorisation."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186b-ss-6-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186b-ss-6"
