      "cml:integrityHash": "826be44816a7685986327eb237534384e870a46f8ce9c0f376cabee6d54c1cad",
      "skos:note": "Specify a place and time for attendance under inspection.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-186c-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "186C(2) Power to obtain relevant information",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 423,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A requirement under subsection (1) to attend before an inspecting\nofficer must specify:\n\n(a) a place for the attendance; and\n\n(b) a period within which, or a time and day when, the\nattendance is to occur.\nThe place, and the period or the time and day, must be reasonable\nhaving regard to the circumstances in which the requirement is\nmade."
    },
