      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) However: (a) ...; (b) ...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "... except in a proceeding by way of a prosecution for an offence against section 133, 181A, 181B or 182, or against Part 7.4 or 7.7 of the Criminal Code."
    },
    {
