    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186f-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "186F(4) Exchange of information between Ombudsman or",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-186f-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.426",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If an IGIS official has obtained, under the Inspector-General of\nIntelligence and Security Act 1986, information relating to an\nauthority of a State or Territory about the performance of functions\nof an intelligence agency (within the meaning of that Act) and its\nofficers relating to:\n\n(a) Chapter 3 or 4 of this Act; or\n\n(b) Part 15 of the Telecommunications Act 1997 in relation to the\nperformance of a function, or the exercise of a power,\nconferred by that Part of that Act in connection with a stored\n\nOversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman  Chapter 4A\n\nSection 186G\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\ncommunications warrant or an authorisation under",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If an IGIS official has obtained, under the Inspector-General of\nIntelligence and Security Act 1986, information relating to an\nauthority of a State or Territory about the performance of functions\nof an intelligence agency (within the meaning of that Act) and its\nofficers relating to:\n\n(a) Chapter 3 or 4 of this Act; or\n\n(b) Part 15 of the Telecommunications Act 1997 in relation to the\nperformance of a function, or the exercise of a power,\nconferred by that Part of that Act in connection with a stored\n\nOversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman  Chapter 4A\n\nSection 186G\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\ncommunications warrant or an authorisation under",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186f"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186f-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186f-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "fd292af40390325ce1cb48050ba92addf4148b687f5ee7cbab8a61104288a076",
      "skos:note": "Must provide information about performance of functions of an intelligence agency"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-186f-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "186F(4) Exchange of information between Ombudsman or",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 426,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If an IGIS official has obtained, under the Inspector-General of\nIntelligence and Security Act 1986, information relating to an\nauthority of a State or Territory about the performance of functions\nof an intelligence agency (within the meaning of that Act) and its\nofficers relating to:\n\n(a) Chapter 3 or 4 of this Act; or\n\n(b) Part 15 of the Telecommunications Act 1997 in relation to the\nperformance of a function, or the exercise of a power,\nconferred by that Part of that Act in connection with a stored\n\nOversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman  Chapter 4A\n\nSection 186G\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\ncommunications warrant or an authorisation under"
    },
