      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.428",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If, as a result of an inspection under this Chapter of the records of\nan enforcement agency, the Ombudsman is of the opinion that an\nofficer of the agency has contravened a provision of this Act, the\nOmbudsman may include in his or her report on the inspection a\nreport on the contravention.\n\nOversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman  Chapter 4A\n\nSection 186J\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nNote:\nIn complying with this section, the Ombudsman remains bound by the\nobligations imposed by sections 133, 181B and 182.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If, as a result of an inspection under this Chapter of the records of\nan enforcement agency, the Ombudsman is of the opinion that an\nofficer of the agency has contravened a provision of this Act, the\nOmbudsman may include in his or her report on the inspection a\nreport on the contravention.\n\nOversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman  Chapter 4A\n\nSection 186J\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nNote:\nIn complying with this section, the Ombudsman remains bound by the\nobligations imposed by sections 133, 181B and 182.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186j"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186j-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979-sec-186j-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "35583c4b10a8983600488fb0794e1823c73caba47b751def2bb35b8181f3a95b",
      "skos:note": "Ombudsman may include report on contravention in inspection report."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979#sec-186j-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "186J(5) Reports",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 428,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If, as a result of an inspection under this Chapter of the records of\nan enforcement agency, the Ombudsman is of the opinion that an\nofficer of the agency has contravened a provision of this Act, the\nOmbudsman may include in his or her report on the inspection a\nreport on the contravention.\n\nOversight by the Commonwealth Ombudsman  Chapter 4A\n\nSection 186J\n\nTelecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979\n\nCompilation date: 04/06/2026\n\nNote:\nIn complying with this section, the Ombudsman remains bound by the\nobligations imposed by sections 133, 181B and 182."
    },
