      },
      "dc:source": "telecommunications-interception-and-access-act-1979.pdf, p.428",
      "values:originalText": "(7) A report under this section must not include information which, if\nmade public, could reasonably be expected to:\n\n(a) endanger a person’s safety; or\n\n(b) prejudice an investigation or prosecution; or\n\n(c) compromise any enforcement agency’s operational activities\nor methodologies.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) A report under this section must not include information which, if\nmade public, could reasonably be expected to:\n\n(a) endanger a person’s safety; or\n\n(b) prejudice an investigation or prosecution; or\n\n(c) compromise any enforcement agency’s operational activities\nor methodologies.",
